@Shoebox_HostAddress = http://localhost:5168

### Claim a sandbox. Every run is tagged with this id and nothing is persisted.
POST {{Shoebox_HostAddress}}/sandbox
Accept: application/json

### Is telemetry going anywhere? Tells an unconfigured endpoint from a broken diagram.
GET {{Shoebox_HostAddress}}/otlp/status
Accept: application/json

### Parse a diagram into a topology without emitting anything.
POST {{Shoebox_HostAddress}}/topology/parse
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "diagram": "flowchart LR\n  web[Web]\n  api[[API]]\n  db[(Orders DB)]\n  web --> api\n  api -->|broken: wrong table| db"
}

### Fire exactly one request through the diagram and emit OTLP.
POST {{Shoebox_HostAddress}}/run?sandboxId=00000000000000000000000000000000
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "diagram": "flowchart LR\n  web[Web]\n  api[[API]]\n  db[(Orders DB)]\n  web --> api\n  api -->|broken: wrong table| db",
  "runIndex": 1
}

###
